Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:03.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The subject's name is John Kramer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,a 52-year-old male Caucasian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's seen better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:50.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a recent rectangular transection to the left occipital lobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:54.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Some kind of backdoor brain surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:27.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's check the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get homicide here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:05.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was in his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:09.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you there, detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If so, you are probably
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:49.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the last man standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:54.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now perhaps you will succeed where the others have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:57.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think you will walk away untested?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:01.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that my work will continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:04.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think it's over just because I' dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The games have just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:25.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck? What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:28.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:31.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck? What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:36.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to me. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:53.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:07.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:28.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:56.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What did I do? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:07:57.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:25.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:34.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Right side clear. - Left side clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,In position. Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:14.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I see movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:21.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a device.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:22.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You get eyes in there before you go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get some eyes in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:27.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Moving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:44.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The doorway is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:21.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kerry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:23.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Rigg! - Don't do it! We're not secure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:25.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Rigg, I said no! - Kerry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:27.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Stop him! - Do not go through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Kerry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:11:58.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Get me the coroner's office. - Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody get those rats off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:08.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get the light on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.70,0:12:15.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:20.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I said cut her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:23.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know never to go through an unsecured door, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought she was still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,thought I could save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:46.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you ever think that we would end up here when we first started?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:52.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't see it happening like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why the hell do we still do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's in our nature to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- It's what we do. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Cherish Your Life."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:07.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What? - The fucking motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're supposed to cherish our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How the hell are we supposed to do that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:14.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,when this is our life?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We chose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:22.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You go home. - Hoffman, there are two agents
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.87,0:13:25.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- here to see you. - Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Detective Hoffman? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' special agent Lindsey Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:34.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is special agent Peter Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:36.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How can I help the FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:40.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here about detective Kerry. She was our liaison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:41.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Open the door and you will find me."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:51.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What's this? - The key that came
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:53.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with out last message from detective Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:55.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Open the door and you will find me" mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The crime scene photographer's flash picked up this bullet casing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.05,0:14:13.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was lodged between the body and the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Run it for prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Give us the room for a minute, would you? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The lock was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:34.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She couldn't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:38.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was constructed for her execution. Betrayed the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Not a Jigsaw trap then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Amanda Young, the accomplice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:45.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- This wasn't done by Amanda Young. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:47.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Detective Kerry weighed approximately 130 lbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Amanda Young's arrest report has her at 107.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:51.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- She couldn't get her up there alone. - John Kramer was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:54.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The bedridden cancer patient? He's brains, not brawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was also an engineer. He could have rigged pulleys...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:59.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or someone else could have helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Special agent, if you're here for any other reason than just to assist...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:05.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here to find the person your department couldn't, detective,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the one helping Jigsaw and Amanda Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:10.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:19.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We found a harlequin doll in your possession. What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:21.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a toy. The kids play with toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:24.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:27.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How about the tricycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:29.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The tricycle is from John's youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:32.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,A grown man has a tricycle his whole life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' sure you've kept things that were important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Ms. Tuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:41.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is there any reason we should be concerned for your safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps you should be more concerned for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:45.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you tell me everything you know about John?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And let's start at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:51.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,John's life defies chronology and linear description.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:54.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So why don't we start at the end and work our way backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:56.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I represent Ms. Tuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:05.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have vacation time, right? Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:08.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Finish the remodeling, spend some time with Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:10.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- She understands. - Then don't take her for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:15.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Eric is still out there, man. - Eric's been missing for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:18.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Kerry was gone for four days. I can only be as optimistic
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- as the facts allow. - Yeah, well, I' in it till I find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:22.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Finding his body is not gonna vindicate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:24.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Finding him alive will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:31.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll call you later to make sure everything is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:37.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lieutenant Rigg, our SWAT commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:43.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What's his problem? - Everyone around him keeps dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:06.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:09.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It says, " I tried calling you four times."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It says, "dinner is in the fridge."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:17.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And at the bottom it says, "I love you."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:20.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to help my mom for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:21.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:26.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,come with me, okay? Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:28.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You can,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:35.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:39.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What you can't do is save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:50.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tracy, please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:09.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,John Kramer owned a company called The Urban Renewal Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:12.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No irony in that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:14.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What was Rigg watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.23,0:18:18.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jill Tuck's interrogation. She was Jigsaw's ex. It's old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is a SWAT guy watching that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.23,0:18:24.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Strahm, I really think we should tell Hoffman
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:26.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,what detective Kerry said in her last message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:29.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She said two officers might be in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but until we know who, we're not causing a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:34.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If detective Hoffman or anyone else in this precinct is in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:36.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I think they should know it. - Not your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Making any progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:46.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:48.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, boss, looks like another doctor went missing from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:50.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Maybe it's... - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you need me, call my cell. Coffee machine is around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:58.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- A boy or a girl? - A girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:00.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I didn't know you were married. - I' not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a short story, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:26.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:42.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:29.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Officer Rigg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to your rebirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:33.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:37.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,For years you've stood by and witnessed as your colleagues have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:40.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have remained untouched
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:42.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,while Eric Matthews has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:45.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But with your survival came your obsession...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:48.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,obsession to stop those around you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,from making the wrong choices,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:53.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,thus preventing you from making the right ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:55.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted to save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.35,0:21:57.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight I give you the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:22:00.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to face your obsession. Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:03.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Eric Matthews is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.49,0:22:08.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Eric. - The block of ice he stands upon is melting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:11.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He has but 90 minutes to save himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:15.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Detective Hoffman's fate is linked to Eric's survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.37,0:22:18.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Heed my warning, Officer Rigg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Their lives hang in the balance
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:22.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of your obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:26.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you learn how to let go and truly save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:28.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.25,0:23:05.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't fucking move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:21.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.40,0:23:23.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Take off the mask. Put your hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:26.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:40.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Officer Rigg, your first test.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:43.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The person in front of you is in desperate need of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:46.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But it is not your job to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:48.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You view this person as a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:50.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you want to see what I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.73,0:23:55.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,beneath the mask lies a criminal undeserving of the life she leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.77,0:24:04.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your obsession tells you to save the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.01,0:24:09.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I tell you to walk away. The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.35,0:24:12.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you a cop? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.55,0:24:14.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Are you a cop? - Yeah, I' a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:20.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that? What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.44,0:24:32.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- They're in the gears. - What's in the gears?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.24,0:24:35.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The combination. Get me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.61,0:24:40.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut my hair. Just get me out. Cut my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.21,0:24:41.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Relax, relax. - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.28,0:24:45.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fucking cut my hair, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:47.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:51.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:54.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait wait wait wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.26,0:24:56.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.23,0:24:57.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Shit. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.53,0:25:00.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.33,0:25:02.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fucking let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.77,0:25:06.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get back here, you fucking!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.27,0:25:10.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I' sorry. Please come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.30,0:25:33.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where the hell is the combination?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.10,0:25:34.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:41.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:46.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.41,0:25:48.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got one. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:51.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hold on. - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.65,0:25:55.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.52,0:26:01.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah? - We pulled a print off that casing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.19,0:26:03.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.23,0:26:05.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus. Did you check this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.76,0:26:06.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:14.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got another one. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.31,0:26:18.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hold on. Hold on. - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:20.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got it. 617. 617.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:22.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.32,0:26:31.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:34.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.23,0:26:36.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay okay okay, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:38.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,stay here. Don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.02,0:27:03.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:08.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck are you doing? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:09.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Drop the fucking knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:11.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Please. - Put the knife down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:13.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Put the knife down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.83,0:27:16.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just saved your fucking life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.27,0:27:20.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I' gonna kill you! - Drop the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.48,0:27:32.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, these prints just came in. They're from Officer Rigg.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.35,0:27:33.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Fisk. - Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.02,0:27:36.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We just got a call of "shots fired" from 23 Park Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.72,0:27:39.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Rigg's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.23,0:27:48.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.27,0:27:50.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.37,0:27:53.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,An officer will try to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.31,0:27:57.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If he is successful, then your game begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:59.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This man will use these photos
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:02.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to sentence you for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.38,0:28:04.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And the only way to stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.42,0:28:06.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is taped underneath the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:13.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let him save your life and accept your fate to rot in prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.09,0:28:17.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,or kill him and guarantee your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.93,0:28:19.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.30,0:28:22.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.63,0:29:26.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fucking kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:29.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.26,0:30:26.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rigg!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.43,0:30:30.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Rigg, you in here? Rigg! - Go! Move move move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.06,0:30:34.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.10,0:30:36.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:39.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.92,0:30:51.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.55,0:30:56.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,An APB has been issued for Rigg. Everybody's looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:30:59.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- He has a wife. Where is she? - We haven't located her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.26,0:31:01.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Strahm...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.99,0:31:04.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,two detectives. You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.40,0:31:07.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hoffman... you got a 20 on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.30,0:31:08.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.70,0:31:10.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Hoffman. - Calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.34,0:31:12.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you explain detective Matthews?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.50,0:31:14.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- He's alive. - Six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.41,0:31:17.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Jigsaw never kept anyone that long. - No one but Amanda Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.58,0:31:20.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think he's been fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.51,0:31:22.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why these six?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:28.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hoffman's a decorated lieutenant. He doesn't fit the profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.05,0:31:32.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what you see. But what does he see?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.29,0:31:35.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Rigg trying to save his two friends. - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:37.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You got names and locations on any of these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:39.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Working it. - This is overkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.00,0:31:42.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a setup to announce Rigg is the accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:45.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or a setup for his alibi. Everyone around him keeps dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:48.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he to tell us he's innocent or what the hell these photos
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.44,0:31:51.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,are doing in his apartment? Look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.61,0:31:55.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Move, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.65,0:31:57.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Four Walls Build a Home."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.92,0:31:59.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What does he want us to see on these walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.95,0:32:04.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,One of these pictures doesn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:13.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is who we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.80,0:32:17.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's talk to her, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.54,0:32:24.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jill Tuck... where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.88,0:32:35.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Have them turn off the air in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:44.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Tuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.13,0:32:47.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' special agent Perez. This is special agent Strahm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.27,0:32:49.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to apologize for pulling you out of your place of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.87,0:32:51.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What more do you think I can offer you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:54.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My 100 hours of interrogation tapes
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.47,0:32:56.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and the volumes of evidence taken from my house
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.78,0:32:59.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,weren't enough for you to understand John?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.18,0:33:03.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, it's not John we want to talk about, Ms. Tuck. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:04.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.78,0:33:07.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you want to talk about me? This isn't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.42,0:33:10.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So stop wasting both of our time and get to the real reason
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:12.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,why you've brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.95,0:33:39.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.72,0:33:48.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.19,0:33:49.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.83,0:33:54.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:56.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You fucking hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.30,0:33:59.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you fucking motherfucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.22,0:34:17.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's my girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.06,0:34:23.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.09,0:34:24.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.90,0:34:27.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.37,0:34:29.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.04,0:34:32.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,sir, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.67,0:35:41.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Officer Rigg. In order for you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.71,0:35:43.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to fully understand my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.98,0:35:47.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you must... feel what I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:49.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The photo before you is of a man
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.95,0:35:53.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- in desperate need of help. - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.32,0:35:56.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,In the next room are the tools to his salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:59.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,His life is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:03.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But in the end only he can save himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.63,0:36:08.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful. There are cameras watching...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:13.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and you must hide your identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.37,0:36:16.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.01,0:36:20.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Sir? - What the fuck's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.11,0:36:22.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. You're gonna have to... Look, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.31,0:36:24.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- you're gonna have to go. - People are trying to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.38,0:36:26.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know people are trying to sleep. You're the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.89,0:36:29.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you can't sleep here. You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:31.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well, you can't sleep in here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.72,0:36:34.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not a bed. No, you've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.16,0:36:36.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No, you can't use the bathroom. Look, look, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.49,0:36:37.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna have to go. All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.17,0:36:46.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Chance, here, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.27,0:36:53.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Chance. Chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.75,0:36:57.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.98,0:37:00.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.02,0:37:02.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.69,0:37:12.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Chance, come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.21,0:37:22.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What you got there, huh? What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.77,0:37:25.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here. Come here. What do you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.85,0:37:38.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, "Four walls build a home."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.69,0:37:41.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Care to shed any light on that? - Light on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.99,0:37:44.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,On what your photos are doing at the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.27,0:37:49.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Four walls build a home" ring any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.27,0:37:53.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Cherish your life"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.07,0:37:57.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Cherish your life" is the concept
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.11,0:37:59.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that this whole clinic was built on...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.14,0:38:01.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,cherish your life... your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.25,0:38:04.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- That's his motto. - No, it's your motto...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.18,0:38:06.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,of the clinic you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.95,0:38:10.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck, man. I've been here for three fucking hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.32,0:38:12.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Shut the fuck up. - You shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.79,0:38:14.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you out of your fucking mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.63,0:38:16.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.69,0:38:18.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, guys, come on. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.66,0:38:20.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cecil!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.77,0:38:22.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it, Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.97,0:38:25.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Knock it off now, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.01,0:38:31.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.94,0:38:34.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What the fuck is your problem? - You're my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.15,0:38:38.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're becoming everybody else's too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.62,0:38:49.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel about a husband
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.69,0:38:52.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,who takes a motto from your drug clinic,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.30,0:38:54.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,designed to help people, and twists it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.67,0:38:57.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,into some manic torture mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.80,0:39:01.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That part of John has nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.48,0:39:06.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Ms. Tuck, I just left a room
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.51,0:39:08.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with more blood on the walls than paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:11.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Two officers are missing and there's a growing pile of bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.45,0:39:14.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in their wake. And every detail we unearth
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.95,0:39:17.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,about your Hall of Fame psychopath husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.69,0:39:19.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Ex. - ...points to you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.39,0:39:21.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,as a possible accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.26,0:39:24.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I am just curious as to why.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.60,0:39:26.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, there's a lot of people out there
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.70,0:39:28.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,looking for answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.73,0:39:30.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,wanting to place blame on someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.04,0:39:33.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That person is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.94,0:39:36.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But you know what the best part is?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:38.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have to convince everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.41,0:39:40.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just 12 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.91,0:39:46.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, tell me about his workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.12,0:39:54.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay there. Let me get the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.00,0:39:59.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.43,0:40:02.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is exactly what you've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.73,0:40:04.00,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.17,0:40:06.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.87,0:40:10.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the clock? What's so special about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.54,0:40:12.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Except for the fact the whole deal hung on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:14.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The mechanism inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.75,0:40:16.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's 300 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.05,0:40:18.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Still ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.05,0:40:22.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Withstood the test of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.52,0:40:27.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait till you see this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.30,0:40:34.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.08,0:40:51.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.82,0:40:54.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.56,0:41:00.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This was... this was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.76,0:41:04.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It happened a long time ago. And I paid for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.26,0:41:06.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just let me... just let me go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.30,0:41:11.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's behind that door?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.64,0:41:14.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"One saves a life. One takes it away."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.51,0:41:19.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Try that on the door. Try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.15,0:41:27.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Oh, no no. - Get back. Get back. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:28.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.19,0:42:05.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Eric. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.39,0:42:08.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Help! Help me! - Get away from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.83,0:42:12.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you know about the guy on TV? What do you know about Eric Matthews?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.86,0:42:14.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.83,0:42:19.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What the fuck is this? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.87,0:42:25.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.71,0:42:30.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you are playing this tape, then you are one step closer
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.78,0:42:33.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to truly understanding how to save a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.99,0:42:36.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As an officer of the law, you find yourself torn...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.85,0:42:38.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Who is that? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.62,0:42:41.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Is the man before you a victim or a perpetrator of violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.59,0:42:45.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You sick fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.13,0:42:47.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,His salvation is out of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.20,0:42:52.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It is your choice, if you wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.10,0:42:54.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to put it into his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.14,0:42:56.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Once this lesson is learned,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.17,0:42:58.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you will find yourself one step closer
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.24,0:43:00.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to truly saving Eric Matthews.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.88,0:43:03.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Without you this man's game cannot begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.92,0:43:07.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Force him into position to face his demons
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.52,0:43:10.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and let him make the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.13,0:43:19.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shh. Don't wake up our neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.53,0:43:24.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck. Is this what you do with your spare time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.70,0:43:25.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.90,0:43:28.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Take it all, little girl. Be a good little whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.77,0:43:31.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get on the fucking bed. Get on the bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.51,0:43:33.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.95,0:43:36.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Strap yourself in. Strap yourself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.58,0:43:38.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't make me do this. I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.78,0:43:40.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I know I was wrong. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.92,0:43:45.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.12,0:43:47.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Put your fucking hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.33,0:43:51.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.60,0:43:52.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' sorry. I' sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.17,0:44:00.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, I' really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.30,0:44:03.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What does that say? What does that say?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.78,0:44:06.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.62,0:44:12.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Take them. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.19,0:44:19.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, lvan. As a voyeur,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.62,0:44:22.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you've kept photos of those you have victimized.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.36,0:44:25.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Let me go! - Can you see the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.40,0:44:27.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you have brought them?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.43,0:44:29.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have torn apart their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.70,0:44:33.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have used your body as an instrument of abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.47,0:44:35.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I give you the chance to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.87,0:44:38.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,what is more important...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.91,0:44:42.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,your eyes which have led you blindly astray
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.35,0:44:49.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,or your body which has caused those around you endless suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:52.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have been handed the tools which can save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.36,0:44:55.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Decide quickly, though. In 60 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.23,0:44:58.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the choice will be made for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.23,0:45:02.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.81,0:45:13.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I can do it. One more. I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.81,0:45:32.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.17,0:45:48.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna have to tell me how you got those bruises on your hand and your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.71,0:45:53.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Was this an accident or did someone do this to you on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.48,0:45:57.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You can stop it from happening if you tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.72,0:46:00.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Take a seat, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.06,0:46:02.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.10,0:46:09.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The son of a bitch is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.00,0:46:12.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's done this before. She's allowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.90,0:46:16.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The child's story doesn't corroborate. What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.47,0:46:18.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jane, I can't let you go home right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.98,0:46:20.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Go back to class, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.81,0:46:22.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, Officers, sometimes these kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.01,0:46:25.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,they just get out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.18,0:46:27.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Get your hands off me! - Hey, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.22,0:46:29.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rigg! Rigg!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.09,0:46:32.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No. Get out. Get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.92,0:46:35.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You just made the biggest mistake of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.19,0:46:36.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You hear me? I will take him
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.03,0:46:39.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,for everything he's got, that fucking cocksucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.83,0:46:42.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's sweet, Ms. Tuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.87,0:46:45.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but if you love the guy so much, why leave him?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.84,0:46:48.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- He left me long before I left him. - Okay, people break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.57,0:46:50.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Relationships end. It's called life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.78,0:46:53.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, he started massacring people.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.51,0:46:55.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Gideon meant everything to him. - Gideon? I' sorry, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.05,0:46:59.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know anything about the Chinese zodiac?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:01.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Aw, Jill, no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.22,0:47:03.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't just get pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.25,0:47:05.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was carefully planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.29,0:47:08.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything with John was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:12.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Thanks. - See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.76,0:47:14.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Bye-bye. - Bye. Let me get that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.80,0:47:17.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.57,0:47:19.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Thanks. Have a good night. - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.80,0:47:21.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Good night. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.11,0:47:28.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, honey, you want some company?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:31.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.58,0:47:33.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what this building is?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.69,0:47:38.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a health clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.02,0:47:41.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a beautiful girl. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.53,0:47:50.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My jacket. I forgot my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.43,0:47:52.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I forgot my jacket. - Cecil, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.47,0:47:54.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, please please, Jill. It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.24,0:47:57.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's right there. Please please. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.68,0:48:00.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.72,0:48:10.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.52,0:48:14.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me. I don't want to hurt you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.76,0:48:16.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna open up that fucking door.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.39,0:48:18.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Open that fucking door. Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.93,0:48:21.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.30,0:48:24.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck! What fucking key?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.10,0:48:26.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What key? - That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.30,0:48:28.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.44,0:48:32.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fucking stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.35,0:48:37.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Cecil?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.13,0:48:59.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't cry. No no, hey, you're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.57,0:49:04.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.32,0:49:18.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I need some help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.02,0:49:21.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Orderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.16,0:49:22.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my wife. She's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.96,0:49:25.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- How far along is she, sir? - Seven months.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.97,0:50:09.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All I wanted to do was help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.64,0:50:13.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.25,0:50:16.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They have to help themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.09,0:50:30.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's review:
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.29,0:50:32.26,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Girl loves boy. Boy loves girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.33,0:50:36.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Boy gets girl pregnant. Girl loses baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.33,0:50:39.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Boy turns into a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.60,0:50:42.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jill, I' not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.77,0:50:45.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna want to take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.98,0:50:47.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, she doesn't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.49,0:51:02.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's been identified as lvan Landsness.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.33,0:51:04.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Acquitted of rape three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.43,0:51:07.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Had to gouge out his own eyes in order to release himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.70,0:51:11.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How does something like this get into a motel room undetected?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.84,0:51:13.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.87,0:51:15.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The room's been rented for the past six days
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.97,0:51:19.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to a lawyer named Art Blank. Get this: He went missing two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.34,0:51:21.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Run his name. Get his addresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.11,0:51:24.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Two out of five people on Officer Rigg's apartment walls are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.62,0:51:27.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Every partner he's ever worked with... dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.55,0:51:30.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rigg didn't kill lvan. Ivan made his own choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.92,0:51:32.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that the whole Jigsaw mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.92,0:51:34.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This wasn't about lvan. It wasn't his test.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.79,0:51:37.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It was about Rigg.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.80,0:51:39.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at these photos. Tell me how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.96,0:51:41.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at these women and tell me how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.83,0:51:43.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Angry. Enraged. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.90,0:51:48.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The pimp, the rapist... Jigsaw wanted Rigg to see what he sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.14,0:51:51.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He wants him to feel what he feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.54,0:51:53.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This wasn't about Rigg saving his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.98,0:51:56.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's being recruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.81,0:51:59.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. Art Blank's got a bunch of properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.85,0:52:02.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Last known address is a couple of blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.73,0:52:11.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Right side clear. - Left side clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.86,0:52:13.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Clear. - Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.66,0:52:15.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.20,0:52:23.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.79,0:52:37.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.25,0:52:40.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're the two Jigsaw targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.84,0:52:55.81,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.98,0:53:02.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.95,0:53:06.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.00,0:53:25.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, asshole, you jump off that block,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.87,0:53:27.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you electrocute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.47,0:53:30.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If that ice had melted more, he'd be fried. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.01,0:53:32.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.02,0:53:44.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You just made the biggest mistake of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.22,0:53:45.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- cocksucker! - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.59,0:53:47.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll get somebody to take a look at it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.72,0:53:50.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,My client has a broken nose and a fractured cheekbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.03,0:53:54.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Administrative leave with pay is not acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.07,0:53:58.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The IA investigation is underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.84,0:54:02.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Into this precinct? Wow. What's that gonna get me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.54,0:54:04.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- The truth. - I'll tell you what the truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.81,0:54:07.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is, I have an eyewitness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.44,0:54:10.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The man's wife? She stands to gain as much as he does
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.15,0:54:12.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,if there were to be a financial settlement,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.18,0:54:13.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,which is not gonna happen because he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.92,0:54:15.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He attacked Officer Rigg first.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.95,0:54:17.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's according to whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.99,0:54:20.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Me. I saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.53,0:54:23.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You want to testify before the grand jury?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.69,0:54:26.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I've already signed IA's affidavit. The charges are being dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:29.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you guys are... you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.37,0:54:32.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, you're obviously as thick as thieves in this precinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.40,0:54:34.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But it'll come back to you. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.77,0:54:37.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, one day someday it will. It will come back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.68,0:54:47.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.72,0:54:49.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.32,0:54:51.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.66,0:54:56.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.93,0:55:03.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.05,0:55:21.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna have to tell me how you got
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.12,0:55:24.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,those bruises on your hand and your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.64,0:56:17.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rigg! Rigg!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.50,0:56:42.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I did it! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.83,0:56:44.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.53,0:56:46.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,L...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.35,0:56:57.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.02,0:57:03.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The human body is a fascinating organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.75,0:57:05.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It can withstand the most brutal injury...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.02,0:57:10.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and yet repair itself miraculously.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.19,0:57:12.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But you know this all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.23,0:57:14.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How many broken bones have you suffered
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.30,0:57:16.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,at the hands of your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.00,0:57:19.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How many flesh wounds have you endured?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.80,0:57:21.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.14,0:57:25.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,With time, the bruises have healed, but your pain has not.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:32.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Today I empower you to take control of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.08,0:57:34.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you disconnect from the one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.22,0:57:36.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that has brought you and others so much pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.05,0:57:39.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,With time your wounds will heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.26,0:57:43.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,His, however, will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.73,0:57:50.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Remove the ties that bind...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.60,0:57:51.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.80,0:57:54.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,...or bleed to death from you inactivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.10,0:57:56.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.14,0:57:58.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Okay okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.94,0:58:00.27,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.25,0:58:06.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.32,0:58:13.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Morgan, Morgan, what the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.49,0:58:48.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help me. Please help me. I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.79,0:58:50.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Please help me! - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.96,0:58:53.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't go. Don't go. Don't go. Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.16,0:58:55.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please get me out. Please get me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.23,0:58:57.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't. Don't go. Don't leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.90,0:59:00.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.87,0:59:03.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Officer Rigg. What have you learned thus far?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.91,0:59:06.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Experience is a harsh teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.31,0:59:08.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,First comes the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.38,0:59:11.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Second comes the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.15,0:59:13.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you are to save as I save
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.68,0:59:16.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,then you will see that the person before you
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.55,0:59:18.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is but a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.19,0:59:20.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So I ask you, Officer Rigg,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.99,0:59:22.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,has the pupil learned her lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.03,0:59:26.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Has she been taught the error of her ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.53,0:59:28.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Does she now
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.30,0:59:30.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- view the world differently? - Please help.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.54,0:59:34.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Officer Rigg, the key to this person's freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.84,0:59:37.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,lies in the palm of your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.74,0:59:40.14,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But only after she has done her own part
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.21,0:59:43.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,can you play your role in her salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.81,0:59:46.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Once judgment has been made, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.18,0:59:48.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the key to finding your next destination
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.92,0:59:51.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,is just off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.35,0:59:54.45,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Who did this to you? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.03,0:59:57.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help, please. Help, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.86,0:59:59.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay still. I' gonna try to take this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.21,1:00:13.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.48,1:00:15.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.55,1:00:19.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it. "Just off the map."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.32,1:00:21.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just off the map.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.55,1:00:25.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.26,1:00:28.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Go home."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.46,1:00:33.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.23,1:00:35.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' so cold. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.24,1:00:45.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.15,1:00:51.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.12,1:00:56.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't leave me. Please don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.95,1:00:58.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help me, please. Don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.99,1:01:06.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to stop playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.90,1:01:12.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you fucking kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.10,1:01:13.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.31,1:01:19.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Shut up! - I don't want to play anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.55,1:01:24.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Save as I save."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.58,1:01:26.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,So what did he do, free her and let him die?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.78,1:01:28.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This guy didn't have a chance. He's got rods going through
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.02,1:01:31.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,every major artery in his body. "Your life is in her hands."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.79,1:01:33.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Rigg didn't kill this guy. His wife did.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.82,1:01:36.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She identified Officer Rigg, said he saved her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.83,1:01:38.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Saved? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.56,1:01:41.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She passed Rigg's judgment, got fixed and got her freedom back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.47,1:01:47.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah. - Second address?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.17,1:01:52.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Okay, yeah. That's good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.04,1:01:55.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But I still need that address. Text me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.41,1:01:58.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I just found out something interesting about the three people in the traps.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.72,1:02:02.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They were all represented by a lawyer named Art Blank.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.19,1:02:04.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- He got them all off? - Yeah. But wait, it gets better.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.49,1:02:05.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's also Jill Tuck's lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.29,1:02:09.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.30,1:02:16.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- The lair... where's the lair? - Raided. It doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.43,1:02:18.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jigsaw wanted us to find that place. Where's the new game being played?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.07,1:02:20.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We find that place... we find Rigg.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.57,1:02:22.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We got a second address. There's a co-owner.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.01,1:02:24.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Who? - Jill Tuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.41,1:02:27.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Jill Tuck? Where's the building? - Here. This building.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.38,1:03:38.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Agent Perez.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.18,1:03:42.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And welcome to the world that you have long studied.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.09,1:03:43.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your partner Agent Strahm
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.99,1:03:47.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,will soon take the life of an innocent man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.69,1:03:50.18,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Heed my warning, Agent Perez.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.26,1:03:53.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your next move is critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.50,1:03:55.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Open the door...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.23,1:04:00.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.82,1:04:13.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.15,1:04:19.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Paramedics!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.02,1:04:21.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.29,1:04:25.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay with me. Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.70,1:04:27.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shallow breaths. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.73,1:04:29.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay with me. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.33,1:04:31.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. You're gonna be fine. You're gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.03,1:05:04.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.90,1:05:07.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.94,1:05:09.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.57,1:05:12.41,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.48,1:05:14.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.18,1:05:17.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.35,1:05:19.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.89,1:05:27.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Stop. Stop. - Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.12,1:05:28.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.59,1:05:33.93,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop. Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.00,1:05:35.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.87,1:05:38.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me. I' not the one you've got to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.57,1:05:41.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You understand me? I' not the one you've got to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.44,1:05:43.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.64,1:05:46.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As a matter of fact, I recommend you stay alive
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.04,1:05:50.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,until the fucking clock counts down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.71,1:05:55.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the good news: If this other guy passes his test,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.69,1:05:58.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the three of us can go free.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.96,1:06:00.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.89,1:06:02.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.79,1:06:05.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't stay on the block, your partner gets electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.96,1:06:08.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now for my final task.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.20,1:06:12.57,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.70,1:06:15.60,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Live or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.67,1:06:17.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.78,1:06:21.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Mrs. Perez?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.28,1:06:24.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi. This is Peter Strahm. I work with your daughter Lindsay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.05,1:06:28.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I have some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.46,1:07:08.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,See that, Jill? That's a federal fucking indictment. It's got your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.56,1:07:11.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna put somebody else's name on it? You start talking to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.73,1:07:13.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with the doll? What's with the tricycle?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.50,1:07:15.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who were John's business associates before he went insane?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.87,1:07:17.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He wasn't the associate type.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.00,1:07:20.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where the hell is Art Blank?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.00,1:07:23.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Obstruction of justice. Aiding and abetting.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.17,1:07:25.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Conspirator to murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.51,1:07:26.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.91,1:07:29.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,In 15 minutes, more people are gonna die, Jill... police officers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.01,1:07:31.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a business partner. He's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.85,1:07:34.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the accomplice we have been looking for
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.12,1:07:35.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and he is your fucking lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.12,1:07:41.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You see this? This is my partner's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.29,1:07:43.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,She's fighting for her life right now
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.73,1:07:46.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,because of your lunatic husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.90,1:07:49.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened between Jigsaw and Art Blank?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.70,1:07:51.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,John?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.94,1:07:55.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,John.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.47,1:07:59.44,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess he's not here either.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.51,1:08:02.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck is this place, Jill?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.65,1:08:10.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Don't be mad. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.49,1:08:17.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.09,1:08:20.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You weren't returning my calls, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.03,1:08:24.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, John, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.90,1:08:26.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' sorry. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.94,1:08:29.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened was a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.91,1:08:32.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But I gotta tell you...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.61,1:08:35.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,listen, John, I gotta tell you, those buildings we're working on...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.11,1:08:37.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You take 'em. You give my share to Jill.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.15,1:08:40.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the way it works, John. You see, we're partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.28,1:08:42.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your designs will make those buildings special.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.79,1:08:45.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got 40 families ready to move in... 40 families, John,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.32,1:08:47.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,low-income families.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.59,1:08:49.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.39,1:08:51.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're their savior, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.43,1:08:53.49,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.56,1:08:55.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you talking to like that? It's me, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.83,1:08:58.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Did you hear what I said? - Oh, I heard you, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.04,1:09:04.01,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Get the fuck...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.01,1:09:07.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.51,1:09:14.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, John. You take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.75,1:09:18.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Gimme a call when you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.11,1:09:39.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He blamed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.11,1:09:41.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think he could ever forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.78,1:09:44.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,In his mind our time was over.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.52,1:09:47.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was diagnosed with cancer soon after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.33,1:10:00.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you try to contact him again?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.73,1:10:02.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.63,1:10:06.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But a different person crawled out of the wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.17,1:10:08.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone else survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.04,1:10:41.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I asked you not to come here. - I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.94,1:10:43.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,John, John,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.97,1:10:47.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,look at this. What is this, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.24,1:10:49.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you have Cecil's picture?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.28,1:10:51.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What have you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.31,1:10:55.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I told him not to take life for granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.92,1:10:57.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.95,1:11:00.98,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your life is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.06,1:11:03.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now comes your moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.09,1:11:05.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As a drug user and a hustler,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.13,1:11:08.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you've played roulette with other people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.53,1:11:10.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Today you play with your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.50,1:12:16.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.27,1:12:23.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.61,1:12:30.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.65,1:12:32.20,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.28,1:12:35.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No, you did this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.65,1:12:39.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your greed took the life of an innocent child.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.09,1:12:42.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you give me time to explain, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.19,1:12:44.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't give you time. No one can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.86,1:12:46.35,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Time's an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.43,1:12:49.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, look, I' sorry. I' sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.73,1:12:51.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgive you, Cecil. I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.83,1:12:53.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Addiction has ruined your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.70,1:12:55.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' bleeding, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.47,1:12:57.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.01,1:13:00.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I could let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.21,1:13:03.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That wouldn't serve you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.18,1:13:07.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell you what I will do, though. I'll give you a tool
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.28,1:13:10.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to reclaim your life,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.32,1:13:13.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to discard the vices that have so corrupted your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.59,1:13:15.56,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have a fucking soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.63,1:13:17.62,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you will in the next life, Cecil.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.69,1:13:19.99,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You see, things aren't sequential.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.06,1:13:22.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Good doesn't lead to good, nor bad to bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.77,1:13:24.46,en,,0000,0000,0000,,People steal, don't get caught,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.53,1:13:26.50,en,,0000,0000,0000,,live the good life.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.57,1:13:28.63,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Others lie, cheat
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.70,1:13:30.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and get elected.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.71,1:13:33.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Some people stop to help a stranded motorist
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.41,1:13:37.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and get taken out by a speeding semi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.18,1:13:39.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no accounting for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.62,1:13:42.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,How you play the cards you're dealt... that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.95,1:13:45.28,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.35,1:13:47.19,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand what I' saying to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.26,1:13:49.92,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.99,1:13:52.12,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.46,1:13:55.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're fucking nuts!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.84,1:14:11.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.32,1:14:15.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the tool...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.15,1:14:17.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the tool that's going to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.35,1:14:19.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.26,1:14:23.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your life is a lie, Cecil.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.86,1:14:27.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now comes your moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.16,1:14:30.10,en,,0000,0000,0000,,As a drug addict and a thief,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.17,1:14:32.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you've preyed on the kindness of others
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.40,1:14:34.39,en,,0000,0000,0000,,to fuel your addiction.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.47,1:14:36.80,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Today we're bringing
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.87,1:14:39.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,the ugliness inside you out into the open.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.54,1:14:41.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now in order for you to stay alive
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.74,1:14:44.21,en,,0000,0000,0000,,we have to match your face
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.28,1:14:47.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,with the ugliness of your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.45,1:14:52.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Just lean forward into the knives with your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.82,1:14:55.05,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Press hard enough
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.12,1:14:58.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,and you'll release the arm and the leg restraints
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.23,1:15:00.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that bind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.73,1:15:02.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Press hard, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.17,1:15:05.90,en,,0000,0000,0000,,And you'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.97,1:15:08.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You sick fuck! Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.77,1:15:13.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Or you can sit idly and bleed out on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.74,1:15:17.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Live or die, Cecil.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.11,1:15:19.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.99,1:15:31.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck you, you sick fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.39,1:15:32.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.75,1:16:26.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.22,1:16:28.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You're fucking dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.35,1:16:32.48,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fucking dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.07,1:16:48.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.61,1:16:53.07,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.14,1:16:54.97,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What's happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.59,1:17:05.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.19,1:17:09.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You do it for yourself if you can't do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.93,1:17:12.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I lost him too.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.73,1:17:51.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Four Walls Build a Home."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.44,1:18:01.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your son was named after John's first building, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.78,1:18:04.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yes. - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.15,1:18:06.71,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.78,1:18:09.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.78,1:18:30.34,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.01,1:18:31.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.01,1:19:22.53,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.09,1:19:29.16,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck. Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.53,1:19:34.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better hope he doesn't come through that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.77,1:19:37.86,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who? Who's coming through the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.38,1:19:44.78,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.65,1:20:19.94,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Where the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.02,1:20:23.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Gideon Meat Packing, 11235 Blake drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.75,1:20:25.72,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.65,1:20:50.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.65,1:20:52.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.65,1:20:54.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.65,1:21:08.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.22,1:21:29.65,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's coming through the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.06,1:21:43.03,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.52,1:22:04.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations, Art.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.49,1:22:40.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.76,1:22:46.25,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's coming through the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.33,1:22:48.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.96,1:22:50.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the fuck is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.60,1:22:54.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.44,1:22:59.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.21,1:23:03.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fix me, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.05,1:23:08.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' standing right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.15,1:23:12.64,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Your time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.72,1:23:14.75,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Please think about what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.16,1:23:22.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Think about what you promised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.23,1:23:23.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Think about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.77,1:23:25.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lynn?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.54,1:23:30.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Lynn! Lynn!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.45,1:23:41.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.89,1:23:53.02,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.10,1:23:56.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,This will release us when the timer's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.50,1:24:02.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Release me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.61,1:24:09.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Which is it gonna be, Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.65,1:24:11.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Live or die, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.68,1:24:13.77,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.85,1:24:15.54,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.59,1:24:18.55,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.62,1:24:20.59,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeff!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.89,1:24:26.79,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Eric! - Don't open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.86,1:24:28.73,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.00,1:24:32.23,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.37,1:25:14.67,en,,0000,0000,0000,,"Open the door and you will find me."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.62,1:25:29.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Let me see your fucking hands. - Where is my daughter, you mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.79,1:25:32.95,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.30,1:25:43.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.58,1:25:57.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Fuck! - Aw, you stupid motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.65,1:25:59.68,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- What did you do? - I had more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.76,1:26:03.38,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- I still had fucking time. - Why did you open that door?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.46,1:26:05.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- You fucking did this! - No, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.23,1:26:09.29,en,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Jigsaw's testing you, you fucking piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.36,1:26:11.96,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Put your fucking hands where I can see them!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.03,1:26:14.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Jigsaw's fucking testing you. - Don't fucking move!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.24,1:26:20.04,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Officer Rigg.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.11,1:26:22.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,If you are hearing this, then you have reached
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.81,1:26:25.61,en,,0000,0000,0000,,detective Matthews and detective Hoffman
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.68,1:26:28.15,en,,0000,0000,0000,,in under 90 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.22,1:26:30.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,resulting in their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.39,1:26:32.58,en,,0000,0000,0000,,The rules were clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.65,1:26:34.52,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You were warned.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.59,1:26:36.32,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- It's Kerry! - Do not go through that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.39,1:26:39.33,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You know never to go through an unsecured door, ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.50,1:26:42.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight you face your obsession.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.90,1:26:45.66,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What you can't do is save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.73,1:26:47.76,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you learn how to let go?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.80,1:26:51.36,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- Eric is still out there, man. - It's time to let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.44,1:26:53.91,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Detective Matthews has but 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.98,1:26:56.24,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I recommend you stay alive
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.31,1:26:58.40,en,,0000,0000,0000,,until the fucking clock counts down.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.48,1:27:00.47,en,,0000,0000,0000,,They had to save themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.52,1:27:03.31,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Take 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.45,1:27:09.08,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Their salvation was out of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.16,1:27:11.13,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Time was on your side,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.19,1:27:13.89,en,,0000,0000,0000,,but your obsession wouldn't let you wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.96,1:27:16.83,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of saving detective Matthews,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.90,1:27:18.87,en,,0000,0000,0000,,you cost him his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.93,1:27:21.06,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You failed your final test.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.81,1:27:31.84,en,,0000,0000,0000,,What I don't understand is how the hell could Jigsaw do all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.91,1:27:33.85,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He was damn near on his deathbed the last time we saw him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.92,1:27:35.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I' not so sure he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.56,1:27:44.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- This wasn't done by Amanda Young. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.89,1:27:46.88,en,,0000,0000,0000,,- She couldn't get her up there alone. - John Kramer was...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.96,1:27:48.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,He's brains, not brawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.76,1:27:51.70,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here to find the person helping Jigsaw and Amanda Young.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.94,1:28:04.17,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like another doctor went missing from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.25,1:28:09.51,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.52,1:28:14.11,en,,0000,0000,0000,,We chose this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.41,1:28:33.37,en,,0000,0000,0000,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.40,1:29:03.74,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You feel you now have control, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.84,1:29:08.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think you will walk away untested?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.78,1:29:19.22,en,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise that my work will continue.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.29,1:29:22.42,en,,0000,0000,0000,,That I have ensured.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.49,1:29:24.82,en,,0000,0000,0000,,By hearing this tape some will assume
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.89,1:29:26.69,en,,0000,0000,0000,,that this is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.76,1:29:30.09,en,,0000,0000,0000,,But I am still among you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.17,1:29:33.43,en,,0000,0000,0000,,You think it's over just because I am dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.50,1:29:37.30,en,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not over. The games have just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:03.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,解剖对象是约翰·克里莫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,52岁，白种男性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经风光一时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:50.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,左脑枕叶部位有个近期的方形切口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:54.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来是次地下颅部手术
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:27.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看看胃里有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把凶杀科的人找来，快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:05.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,胃里面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:09.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,切开它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗，警探？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是的话，你可能就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:49.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一个活着的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:54.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,现在可能你做到了其他人做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:57.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你能不接受考验就离开？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:01.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我的事业仍将继续
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:04.59,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我死了就结束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.26,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,游戏才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:25.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西？什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:28.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:31.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西？什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:36.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,说话？你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:53.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:07.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:28.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你在对我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:56.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我犯了什么错？ 救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:07:57.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别靠近我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:25.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我犯了什么错？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:33.60,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,《电锯惊魂4》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 右边安全 - 左边安全
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,安全
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,各就各位 原地待命
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:14.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,有动静
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:21.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,机器人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:22.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让机器人先进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,放摄像头进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:27.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,正在设置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:44.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,门口安全
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:21.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是凯瑞！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:23.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 瑞格！ - 别动，不安全！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:25.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 瑞格，我说了别动！ - 凯瑞！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:27.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 停下他 - 别进那扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,凯瑞！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:11:58.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把验尸官找来 - 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谁把她身上的老鼠弄掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:08.26,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,去把灯打开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把她弄下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.70,0:12:15.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:20.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我说把她弄下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:23.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你想找死吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道永远不要乱闯没确认安全的门 永远
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.45,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是以为她还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,以为我能救她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:46.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有想过一开始，我们就会死在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:52.57,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过这样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么我们还要做？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救他们这是我们的本能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是我们的工作 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“珍惜你的生命”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:07.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - TMD标语
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该珍惜我们的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这就是我们的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:14.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么珍惜？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们选择了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:22.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你回去 - 霍夫曼，两个特别警探
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.87,0:13:25.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要见你 - 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 霍夫曼警探？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我是特别警探琳达丝·派瑞兹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:34.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是特别警探彼特·史特姆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:36.74,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我能为FBI做点什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:40.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来这里是因为凯瑞警探 她是我们的联络员
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:41.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“打开门就能找到我”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:51.39,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么？ - 这把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:53.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,和凯瑞警探给我们的最后消息在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:55.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“打开门就能找到我”对你来说意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.41,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,尸体在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,犯罪现场摄影师的灯光照到这个弹壳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.05,0:14:13.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,在尸体和设备之间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,检查下指纹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,方便回避一下么？谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,锁打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:34.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她不可能逃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:38.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为她的死刑造的，违反了规则
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,所以这不是竖锯的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不是，阿曼达·杨，那个同伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:45.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不可能是阿曼达·杨干的 - 对不起？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:47.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,凯瑞警探大约130磅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,阿曼达·杨被捕时107磅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:51.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她不可能一个人把她弄上去 - 约翰·克里莫是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:54.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那个卧病在床的癌症患者？ 他只能能动脑子，干不了体力活的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他还是个工程师 他可以用机械的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:59.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,或者找个人帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,特别探员，如果你来这里不是为了帮忙…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:05.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来这里只是找一个你们找不到的人，警探
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那个帮助竖锯还有阿曼达·杨的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:10.41,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:19.41,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在你这里发现了这个小丑玩具 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:21.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,只是个玩具 小孩都爱玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:24.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:27.35,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那这个三轮车呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:29.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这个三轮车是约翰年轻时候的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:32.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,成年人把一辆三轮车保存了一生？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定你也会把你重要的东西保存下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，塔克女士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:41.26,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么理由我们需要保护你的安全？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你更需要保护自己的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:45.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不告诉我们你所知道约翰的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们从头开始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:51.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰一生都在反对年代学还有顺序描述
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:54.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们为什么不从最后开始往回看？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:56.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我代表塔克女士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她知道一些事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:05.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你有假期的，对吗？ 用掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:08.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,完成你家的重新装修 陪陪翠西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:10.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她能理解 - 别想当然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:15.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾瑞克还在受折磨，兄弟 - 艾瑞克已经失踪六个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:18.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,凯瑞也死了四天了，只能有点阿Q精神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但都已经发生了啊 - 是的，嗯，我在找到他之前不会走的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:22.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,找到他的尸体说明不了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:24.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他活着就能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候放手了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:31.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我晚点打电话给你确认一切正常
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:37.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格中尉，我们特警队的队长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:43.20,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他怎么了？ - 他身边的人一个个死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:06.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,里面写些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:09.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,写了“打了四次电话给你”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,写了“晚饭在冰箱里”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:17.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,最下面是"我爱你"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:20.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去帮我妈妈几天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:21.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.74,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:26.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我一起去，好吗？ 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:28.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:35.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:39.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能拯救每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:50.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,翠西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,翠西，你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:09.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·克里莫有个公司名字叫“城市再生集团”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:12.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,够讽刺，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:14.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.23,0:18:18.13,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔·塔克的审问 她是竖锯的前妻，老故事了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一个特警队员会看这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.23,0:18:24.13,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,史特姆，我真的觉得我们应该告诉霍夫曼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:26.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,凯瑞警探最后告诉我们的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:29.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,说两个警官可能有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.57,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但是在我们知道是谁之前我不想制造恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:34.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果霍夫曼警探或者这个辖区内的任何一个人有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:36.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我觉得他们应该知道 - 不是你说了算
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么进展？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:46.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很好，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:48.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，老板，看起来又有一个医生从医院消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:50.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可能是… - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我会弄清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要的话打我手机 咖啡机在角落那边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:58.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 男孩还是女孩？ - 女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:00.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我都不知道你已经结婚了 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我，这只是个很短的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:26.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,翠西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:42.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,翠西？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:29.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，瑞格警官
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到你的重生考验
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:33.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:37.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这几年来你一直见证着你同事的死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:40.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克·马修斯失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:42.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你却没事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:45.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你的幸存给你带来了困扰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:48.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道怎么停止周围的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.13,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,做错误的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:53.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,而这影响到了你的正确选择
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:55.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你想拯救每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.35,0:21:57.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我给你一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:22:00.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,面对你的困扰 看清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:03.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克·马修斯还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.49,0:22:08.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾瑞克 - 他脚下的冰正在融化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:11.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他只有90分钟拯救自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:15.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,霍夫曼警探和他命悬一线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.37,0:22:18.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,记住的我警告 瑞格警官
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.77,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的生死取决于你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:22.81,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是否能解决你的困扰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:26.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你能学会会放手，真正的解救他们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:28.41,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,自己选择
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.25,0:23:05.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:21.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.40,0:23:23.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,拿开面具 把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:26.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:40.59,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格警官 你的第一个测验
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:43.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你前面这个人 现在很绝望，需要你帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:46.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但是救他们不是你的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:48.59,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为这个人是个受害者
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:50.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你看到了我看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.73,0:23:55.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,面具下面是一个本不该活到今天的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.77,0:24:04.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的困扰让你想救这个受害者
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.01,0:24:09.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我让你走开 自己选择
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.35,0:24:12.48,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是警察？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.55,0:24:14.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是警察？ - 是，我是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:20.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？你做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.44,0:24:32.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它们在齿轮里面 - 什么在齿轮里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.24,0:24:35.54,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,密码 让我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.61,0:24:40.13,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,剪掉我的头发，让我出去 剪掉我的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.21,0:24:41.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放松，放松 - 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.28,0:24:45.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,TMD剪掉我的头发，求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:47.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让我出去!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:51.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了，你要去干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:54.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,等等，等等，等等
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.26,0:24:56.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.23,0:24:57.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 靠 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.53,0:25:00.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.33,0:25:02.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,TMD让我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.77,0:25:06.20,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,回来，你这个贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.27,0:25:10.64,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好的，对不起，请回来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.30,0:25:33.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,密码TM在什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.10,0:25:34.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,靠，靠
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:41.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住！坚持住！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:46.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,找到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.41,0:25:48.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,找到一个，坚持住！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:51.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 坚持住 - 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.65,0:25:55.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,噢，天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.52,0:26:01.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？ - 弹壳上找到个指纹
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.19,0:26:03.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,发现了是谁的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.23,0:26:05.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪，你确认？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.76,0:26:06.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,两遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,快点，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:14.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,又找到一个，坚持住
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.31,0:26:18.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 坚持住，坚持住！ - 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:20.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了，617，617
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:22.35,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持，坚持，坚持！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.32,0:26:31.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:34.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.23,0:26:36.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好，好，好，听着
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:38.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这，别乱碰东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.02,0:27:03.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么狗屁？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:08.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TM在干嘛？ 你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:09.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,TMD放下刀子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:11.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 - 放下刀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:13.77,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,放下刀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.83,0:27:16.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚才救了你的狗命
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.27,0:27:20.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要杀了你 - 放下刀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.48,0:27:32.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，指纹找到了 是瑞格警官的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.35,0:27:33.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 费史克 - 现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.02,0:27:36.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们接到报警说23区有枪声
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.72,0:27:39.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那是瑞格的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.23,0:27:48.20,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，布兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.27,0:27:50.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟你玩个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.37,0:27:53.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,一个警官将会试着救你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.31,0:27:57.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他成功了，你的游戏就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:59.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这个人会用这些照片
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:02.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,指控你的罪行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.38,0:28:04.35,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的阻止办法
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.42,0:28:06.41,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就在电视机下的柜子里面
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:13.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让他救你，然后把你送进监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.09,0:28:17.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,或者杀了他，重获自由
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.93,0:28:19.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,自己选择
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.30,0:28:22.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（有人救人…有人杀人）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.63,0:29:26.60,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我TM杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:29.10,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你个狗娘养的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.26,0:30:26.38,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.43,0:30:30.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 瑞格，你在里面么？瑞格 - 走，走走走！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.06,0:30:34.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.10,0:30:36.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,找到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:39.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,找到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.92,0:30:51.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.55,0:30:56.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格被全境通缉了 所有人都在找他
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:30:59.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他有个老婆，在哪里？ - 还没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.26,0:31:01.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,史特姆
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.99,0:31:04.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,两个警探，你看到了这个么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.40,0:31:07.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,霍夫曼…找到他了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.30,0:31:08.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.70,0:31:10.26,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 找霍夫曼 - 正在找
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.34,0:31:12.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么解释马修警探？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.50,0:31:14.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他还活着 - 六个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.41,0:31:17.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 竖锯不会让任何人活这么久 - 除了阿曼达·杨
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.58,0:31:20.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他已经被洗脑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.51,0:31:22.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这六个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:28.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,霍夫曼是个中尉 不符合他的挑选方式
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.05,0:31:32.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是你这么认为而已 但他怎么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.29,0:31:35.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 瑞格试着救他的朋友 - 可能
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:37.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,找到这些人的名字和地址了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:39.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 正在找 - 这是不必要的谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.00,0:31:42.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,宣布瑞格是他的同伙是个阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:45.57,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,或者是证明他无辜的 他旁边的人一个一个死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:48.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了告诉我们他是清白的 不然这些照片为什么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.44,0:31:51.57,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.61,0:31:55.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,请让开一下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.65,0:31:57.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“四面墙组成一个家”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.92,0:31:59.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他想让我们从墙上看到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,受害者？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.95,0:32:04.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这个照片不是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:13.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们在找的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.80,0:32:17.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,找她谈谈，现在
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.54,0:32:24.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔·塔克…她在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.88,0:32:35.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们关掉里面的空调
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:44.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,塔克女士
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.13,0:32:47.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我是特别警探派瑞兹 这是特别警探史特姆
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.27,0:32:49.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉把你从工作的地方拉过来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.87,0:32:51.46,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得我们还能给你什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:54.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,100小时的审问
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.47,0:32:56.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,加上我房子里带走的一堆证据
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.78,0:32:59.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,还不够你们了解约翰？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.18,0:33:03.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上，找你来不是要说约翰的 塔克女士，是你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:04.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.78,0:33:07.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么要说我？ 这和我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.42,0:33:10.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那么别浪费彼此的时间 直接说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:12.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么带我来这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.95,0:33:39.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.72,0:33:48.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让我走
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.19,0:33:49.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.83,0:33:54.39,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:56.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TM听到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.30,0:33:59.10,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.22,0:34:17.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是我的女孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.06,0:34:23.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TM在看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.09,0:34:24.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,恩？什么狗屁？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.90,0:34:27.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.37,0:34:29.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,先生，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.04,0:34:32.06,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,先生，我能帮你什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.67,0:35:41.64,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，瑞格警官 为了让你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.71,0:35:43.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,完全理解我的行事方式
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.98,0:35:47.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须… 感觉我所感觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:49.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你前面这张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.95,0:35:53.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是一个需要帮助的绝望的男人 - 先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.32,0:35:56.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,在旁边的房间里有拯救他的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:59.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他的命在你手里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:03.06,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但是最后只有他才能救他自己
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.63,0:36:08.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,小心，那里有摄像头…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:13.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须隐藏身份
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.37,0:36:16.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,自己选择
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.01,0:36:20.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生？ - 他TM在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.11,0:36:22.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道，你必须… 看，看
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.31,0:36:24.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你必须走了 - 大家要睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.38,0:36:26.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是的我知道大家要睡觉了，你就是那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.89,0:36:29.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，你不能睡在这里 你必须走了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:31.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是，嗯，你不能睡在这里，知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.72,0:36:34.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是床 不，你必须走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.16,0:36:36.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不，你不能用洗手间 听着，不
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.49,0:36:37.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须走了 好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.17,0:36:46.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,畅丝，过来，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.27,0:36:53.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,畅丝，畅丝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.75,0:36:57.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,畅丝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.98,0:37:00.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.02,0:37:02.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,畅丝
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.69,0:37:12.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,畅丝，过来 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.21,0:37:22.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到了什么？ 你找到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.77,0:37:25.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,过来，过来 你找到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.85,0:37:38.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好，“四面墙组成一个家”
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.69,0:37:41.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以解释下吗？ - 解释什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.99,0:37:44.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的照片为什么会出现在犯罪现场？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.27,0:37:49.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“四面墙组成一个家”对你来说意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.27,0:37:53.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“珍惜你的生命”
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.07,0:37:57.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“珍惜你的生命”这个概念
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.11,0:37:59.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是整个诊所的经营理念
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.14,0:38:01.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,珍惜你的生命，你的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.25,0:38:04.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是他的座右铭 - 不，这是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.18,0:38:06.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你诊所的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.95,0:38:10.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操，我已经来了三小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.32,0:38:12.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闭嘴 - 你TM闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.79,0:38:14.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TM有病啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.63,0:38:16.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.69,0:38:18.59,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，伙计们，好啦，冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.66,0:38:20.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,辛希尔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.77,0:38:22.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,停下，革斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.97,0:38:25.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,马上住手，拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.01,0:38:31.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.94,0:38:34.10,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你TM有什么毛病？ - 你就是我的毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.15,0:38:38.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你正在变成其他所有人的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.62,0:38:49.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这样的一个丈夫怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.69,0:38:52.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他把你诊所用来救人的格言
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.30,0:38:54.60,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,拿出来用来做
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.67,0:38:57.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他折磨别人的座右铭
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.80,0:39:01.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰的那一面和我没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.48,0:39:06.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，塔克女士
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.51,0:39:08.48,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚从一个墙上血比油漆还多的房间里面出来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:11.45,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,两个警官失踪了，而且越来越多的人死了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.45,0:39:14.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,所有我们知道的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.95,0:39:17.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,和你的神经病丈夫有关的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.69,0:39:19.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 前夫 - 都可以说明
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.39,0:39:21.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能是同伙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.26,0:39:24.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是好奇为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.60,0:39:26.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道，外面有很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.70,0:39:28.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,正在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.73,0:39:30.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,一个替罪羊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.04,0:39:33.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.94,0:39:36.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你知道好在什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:38.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不用说服很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.41,0:39:40.60,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,只有12个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.91,0:39:46.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好，说说他的工作室
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.12,0:39:54.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,留在这，我去开灯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.00,0:39:59.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,哇，好大
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.43,0:40:02.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你一直在找的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.73,0:40:04.00,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,很不错，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.17,0:40:06.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,滴-答
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.87,0:40:10.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个钟？有什么特别的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.54,0:40:12.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,除了外面很粗糙之外？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:14.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,里面的机械
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.75,0:40:16.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,已经有300年了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.05,0:40:18.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,还在走
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.05,0:40:22.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,经受住了时间的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.52,0:40:27.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,等你来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.30,0:40:34.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个惊喜给你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.08,0:40:51.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要这么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.82,0:40:54.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.56,0:41:00.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个…那是个错误
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.76,0:41:04.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前的事情了 而且我付出了代价
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.26,0:41:06.06,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让我… 让我走，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.30,0:41:11.56,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,门后面是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.64,0:41:14.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“有些人救人，有些人杀人”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.51,0:41:19.48,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,试试打开门 试试
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.15,0:41:27.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢，不，不 - 退后，退后，退后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:28.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走，走
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.19,0:42:05.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克，天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.39,0:42:08.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救我，救我 - 离远点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.83,0:42:12.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识电视里这个人？ 你知道艾瑞克·马修斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.86,0:42:14.83,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.83,0:42:19.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那TM是什么？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.87,0:42:25.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你要对我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.71,0:42:30.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你在播放这个带子 那么你离
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.78,0:42:33.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,完全了解如何拯救一个人又近一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.99,0:42:36.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个警察 你发现你被撕得…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.85,0:42:38.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是谁？ - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.62,0:42:41.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你前面这个人是个受害者 还是暴力杀人犯？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.59,0:42:45.06,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你这恶心的贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.13,0:42:47.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他的拯救已经不在你手里了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.20,0:42:52.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想的话，你可以
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.10,0:42:54.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让他自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.14,0:42:56.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你学会了这堂课
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.17,0:42:58.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你会发现你离
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.24,0:43:00.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如何真正拯救艾瑞克·马修斯更近了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.88,0:43:03.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你的话这个人不会开始游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.92,0:43:07.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,强迫他就位，面对他的魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.52,0:43:10.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,并且让他自己做决定
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.13,0:43:19.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘，别吵醒邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.53,0:43:24.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操，这就是你平时打发时间做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.70,0:43:25.83,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.90,0:43:28.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,快点宝贝，做个小婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.77,0:43:31.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,滚到床上去，滚到床上去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.51,0:43:33.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.95,0:43:36.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把自己套进去 套进去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.58,0:43:38.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了别这样 我知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.78,0:43:40.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我错了 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.92,0:43:45.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,快点，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.12,0:43:47.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,举起你TMD手来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.33,0:43:51.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道，我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.60,0:43:52.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.17,0:44:00.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.30,0:44:03.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（给他拯救自己性命的工具） 那说什么？那说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.78,0:44:06.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.62,0:44:12.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拿着 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.19,0:44:19.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，艾尔文 作为一个窥探癖
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.62,0:44:22.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你保留的这些照片，你受害者的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.36,0:44:25.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我走 - 你能看到你给这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.40,0:44:27.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,带来的痛苦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.43,0:44:29.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你把他们的生活撕碎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.70,0:44:33.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你用你的身体当作虐待工具
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.47,0:44:35.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我给你机会让你决定
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.87,0:44:38.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是更重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.91,0:44:42.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让你误入歧途的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.35,0:44:49.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,还是你让身边的人受苦的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:52.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你手上的就是拯救你生命的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.36,0:44:55.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,快点决定，否则 六十秒之后
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.23,0:44:58.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我会帮你决定的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.23,0:45:02.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（感受我的感受）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.81,0:45:13.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我能做到的，再来一个 我能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.81,0:45:32.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,(作一个拯救生命的老师，回到一切的初始)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.17,0:45:48.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你手上脖子上的淤青怎么来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.71,0:45:53.41,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是不小心还是有人故意的？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.48,0:45:57.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果告诉我，下次就不会发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.72,0:46:00.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.06,0:46:02.75,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我想回家
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.10,0:46:09.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那个狗娘养的在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.00,0:46:12.83,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他以前就做过了 他老婆居然不管
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.90,0:46:16.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那个小孩的故事也不合理 我能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.47,0:46:18.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,珍，你现在还不能回家，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.98,0:46:20.74,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,回教室去，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.81,0:46:22.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说过了，警官
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.01,0:46:25.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子总是会捣蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.18,0:46:27.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把手拿开！ - 嘿，别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.22,0:46:29.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格！瑞格！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.09,0:46:32.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不，出去，快点出去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.92,0:46:35.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你犯了你这辈子最大的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.19,0:46:36.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吗？我要告他
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.03,0:46:39.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,告到他一无所有，那个王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.83,0:46:42.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来不错，塔克太太
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.87,0:46:45.77,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你那么爱他，为什么要离开他？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.84,0:46:48.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是早就他离开了我 - 好吧，分手很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.57,0:46:50.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,关系早晚会结束，这就是生活
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.78,0:46:53.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他开始虐杀别人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.51,0:46:55.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他想的全是黑暗执政官 - 执政官，抱歉，谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.05,0:46:59.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道中国有个“黄道带”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:01.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,啊，吉尔，不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.22,0:47:03.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不仅是怀孕那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.25,0:47:05.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰把一切都
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.29,0:47:08.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,计划得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:12.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.76,0:47:14.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 - 再见，我帮你开门
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.80,0:47:17.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.57,0:47:19.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢，祝你愉快 - 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.80,0:47:21.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.11,0:47:28.81,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝，想要个人陪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:31.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.58,0:47:33.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是什么地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.69,0:47:38.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是保健所
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.02,0:47:41.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个漂亮女孩，回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.53,0:47:50.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我的外衣，我忘了拿我的外衣
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.43,0:47:52.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我忘了外衣 - 辛希尔，别
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.47,0:47:54.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了，吉尔，就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.24,0:47:57.64,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看，就在那边，求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.68,0:48:00.64,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.72,0:48:10.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.52,0:48:14.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，我不想伤害你，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.76,0:48:16.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把那该死的门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.39,0:48:18.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把那该死的门打开，打开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.93,0:48:21.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,打开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.30,0:48:24.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操！哪一把钥匙？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.10,0:48:26.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪一把？ - 这把
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.30,0:48:28.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,干！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.44,0:48:32.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别TMD动
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.35,0:48:37.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,辛希尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.13,0:48:59.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别哭，别，你不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.57,0:49:04.54,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.32,0:49:18.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.02,0:49:21.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,奥得利
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.16,0:49:22.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我妻子，她怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.96,0:49:25.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 孩子多大了，先生？ - 7个月
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.97,0:50:09.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想帮他们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.64,0:50:13.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能帮他们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.25,0:50:16.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他们必须自救
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.09,0:50:30.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好，我们来总结下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.29,0:50:32.26,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,女孩爱男孩，男孩爱女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.33,0:50:36.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,男孩让女孩怀孕，女孩流产了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.33,0:50:39.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,男孩就变成了连环杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.60,0:50:42.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔，我才不信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.77,0:50:45.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你得来看看这些
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.98,0:50:47.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好，她不准离开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.49,0:51:02.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他的身份证实为艾尔文·兰兹里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.33,0:51:04.35,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,三次强奸指控失败
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.43,0:51:07.45,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他必须凿出自己的眼睛来赎罪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.70,0:51:11.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事在旅馆发生，怎么没人发现？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.84,0:51:13.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,一步一步的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.87,0:51:15.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,过去6天，这房间被一个律师租下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.97,0:51:19.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫亚特·布兰克，还有 这位律师两周前失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.34,0:51:21.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,查查这个名字，找到他的地址
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.11,0:51:24.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格家里，五个人有三个都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.62,0:51:27.48,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,和他合作过的每一个搭档，都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.55,0:51:30.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格并没有杀艾尔文，艾尔文自己做的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.92,0:51:32.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是竖锯颂歌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.92,0:51:34.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,跟艾尔文没关系，这是他的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.79,0:51:37.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是瑞格的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.80,0:51:39.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这些照片，告诉我你的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.96,0:51:41.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这些女人，告诉我你有什么想法
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.83,0:51:43.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 愤怒，暴怒 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.90,0:51:48.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,皮条客，强奸犯，竖锯要让瑞格看到他所看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.14,0:51:51.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到他的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.54,0:51:53.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是瑞格如何救朋友的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.98,0:51:56.74,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他被征募了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.81,0:51:59.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢，亚特·布兰克有好几个住处
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.85,0:52:02.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,最近的住址，离这里只有几个街区
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.73,0:52:11.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 右边安全 - 左边安全
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.86,0:52:13.59,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 安全 - 安全
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.66,0:52:15.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,安全
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.20,0:52:23.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（打开门你就能找到我） （靠得太近，你就会有危险…靠后）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.79,0:52:37.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.25,0:52:40.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在是竖锯的猎物了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.84,0:52:55.81,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.98,0:53:02.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.95,0:53:06.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.00,0:53:25.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，王八蛋，你从冰块上下来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.87,0:53:27.39,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你就电死他
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.47,0:53:30.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果冰块继续融化，他就被烤熟，听懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.01,0:53:32.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听他的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.02,0:53:44.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你犯了这辈子最大的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.22,0:53:45.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 王八蛋！ - 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.59,0:53:47.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找个人来帮你看看，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.72,0:53:50.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我的客户鼻子和颊骨都被打碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.03,0:53:54.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,仅是些行政赔偿是不够的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.07,0:53:58.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,内部调查员马上过来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.84,0:54:02.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,到这个地界上来？能给我带来什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.54,0:54:04.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真相 - 我来告诉你什么是真相
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.81,0:54:07.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,真相是，我有目击证人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.44,0:54:10.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他的老婆？她等着分他老公的钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.15,0:54:12.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有经济赔偿的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.18,0:54:13.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但不会有，因为那家伙撒谎了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.92,0:54:15.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他先攻击了瑞格警官
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.95,0:54:17.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.99,0:54:20.35,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我，我见证了整件事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.53,0:54:23.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你能在陪审团面前指正吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.69,0:54:26.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经在内部调查报告上宣誓了 赔偿已经被取消
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:29.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这群家伙…你们够狠
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.37,0:54:32.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,在这件案子上，你们就跟窃贼一样可耻
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.40,0:54:34.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会遭到报应的，你们知道，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.77,0:54:37.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天，一定会有一天 报应会降临
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.68,0:54:47.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.72,0:54:49.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,婊子养的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.32,0:54:51.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，你懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.66,0:54:56.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.93,0:55:03.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,婊子养的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.05,0:55:21.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须要告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.12,0:55:24.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的手和脖子上怎么会有瘀伤
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.64,0:56:17.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格！瑞格！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.50,0:56:42.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我做到了，我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.83,0:56:44.46,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TMD干了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.53,0:56:46.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.35,0:56:57.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.02,0:57:03.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,人体是很奇妙的有机系统
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.75,0:57:05.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,可以承受最凶狠的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.02,0:57:10.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,然后奇迹般的自我修复
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.19,0:57:12.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但你很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.23,0:57:14.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你有多少骨头被你丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.30,0:57:16.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,亲手打断？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.00,0:57:19.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你有多少血淋淋的伤口？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.80,0:57:21.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.14,0:57:25.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,随着时间消逝，伤口愈合了，但你的痛苦没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:32.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我给你把握自己命运的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.08,0:57:34.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你能从让自己和其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.22,0:57:36.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,从极大的痛苦中解脱出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.05,0:57:39.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,随着时间消逝，你的伤痕会愈合
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.26,0:57:43.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但是，他的不会
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.73,0:57:50.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把束缚解开…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.60,0:57:51.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,放我走！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.80,0:57:54.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,或者因为软弱流血而亡
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.10,0:57:56.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己选择
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.14,0:57:58.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好，好，好！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.94,0:58:00.27,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我拔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.25,0:58:06.77,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.32,0:58:13.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,莫根，莫根，你TMD的在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.49,0:58:48.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我，求你救救我，我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.79,0:58:50.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 求你救救我 - 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.96,0:58:53.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不，不要走，不要走，救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.16,0:58:55.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,求你救救我，求你救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.23,0:58:57.83,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不要走，别把我扔在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.90,0:59:00.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.87,0:59:03.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，瑞格警官，现在你学到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.91,0:59:06.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,经验是严厉的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.31,0:59:08.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,先考验你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.38,0:59:11.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,然后给你上一课
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.15,0:59:13.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你像我一样治病救人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.68,0:59:16.48,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你就会明白你面前的人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.55,0:59:18.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是你的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.19,0:59:20.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格警官，我问你个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.99,0:59:22.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的学生学会了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.03,0:59:26.46,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她知道自己犯的过错了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.53,0:59:28.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她现在
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.30,0:59:30.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 明白世上的艰难了吗？ - 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.54,0:59:34.77,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞格警官，这个人的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.84,0:59:37.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就掌握在你的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.74,0:59:40.14,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但只有她做完自己的那部分
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.21,0:59:43.74,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你才能扮演拯救的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.81,0:59:46.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,而且只有审判结束以后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.18,0:59:48.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你下一站的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.92,0:59:51.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就在图后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.35,0:59:54.45,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是谁干的？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.03,0:59:57.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.86,0:59:59.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别动，我来想办法把它拔出来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.21,1:00:13.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.48,1:00:15.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,干！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.55,1:00:19.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样，“就在图后”
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.32,1:00:21.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就在图后
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.55,1:00:25.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,翠西
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.26,1:00:28.59,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“回家”
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.46,1:00:33.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.23,1:00:35.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,冷死了，求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.24,1:00:45.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想死
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.15,1:00:51.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须拯救自己
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.12,1:00:56.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不要离开我，求你不要离开
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.95,1:00:58.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我，不要走
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.99,1:01:06.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再玩下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.90,1:01:12.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TMD为什么不杀了我？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.10,1:01:13.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.31,1:01:19.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闭嘴！ - 我不想再玩了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.55,1:01:24.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“跟我一样救人”
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.58,1:01:26.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他干了什么，放走她，让他死？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.78,1:01:28.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这个家伙本来就没希望了 这些棍子全都
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.02,1:01:31.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,穿过他的要害 “你的命在她手里”
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.79,1:01:33.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不是瑞格杀了这家伙，是他老婆
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.82,1:01:36.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她认出了瑞格警官，说是他拯救了她
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.83,1:01:38.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拯救？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.56,1:01:41.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她通过了瑞格的审判，重获了自由
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.47,1:01:47.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 第二个地址？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.17,1:01:52.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,真的？好的，不错，不错
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.04,1:01:55.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但我仍需要地址，发给我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.41,1:01:58.64,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我从调查中刚刚发现，这三个接受考验的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.72,1:02:02.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,都请了同一个律师，叫亚特·布兰克
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.19,1:02:04.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他替所有人全部代理？ - 是的，等下，还有更好的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.49,1:02:05.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他也是吉尔·塔克的律师
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.29,1:02:09.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.30,1:02:16.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他的巢穴，巢穴在哪儿？ - 找过了，根本就没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.43,1:02:18.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,竖锯想让我们找到他的巢穴 新的游戏在哪里上演？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.07,1:02:20.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到那个地方，就能找到瑞格
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.57,1:02:22.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了第二个地址，另个人也拥有它
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.01,1:02:24.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁？ - 吉尔·塔克
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.41,1:02:27.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吉尔·塔克？房子在哪儿？ - 这里，就在这栋楼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.38,1:03:38.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，派瑞兹干员
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.18,1:03:42.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到你一直在调查着的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.09,1:03:43.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的搭档史特姆干员
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.99,1:03:47.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就要夺走一个无辜的人的性命
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.69,1:03:50.18,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细听我的警告，派瑞兹干员
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.26,1:03:53.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的下一步很关键
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.50,1:03:55.46,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,打开门…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.23,1:04:00.20,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.82,1:04:13.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,被耍了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.15,1:04:19.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救护！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.02,1:04:21.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.29,1:04:25.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别放弃，听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.70,1:04:27.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢呼吸，呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.73,1:04:29.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,别放弃，没事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.33,1:04:31.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会有事，不会有事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.03,1:05:04.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.90,1:05:07.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你，过来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.94,1:05:09.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.57,1:05:12.41,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.48,1:05:14.10,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.18,1:05:17.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.35,1:05:19.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.89,1:05:27.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 停下 - 婊子养的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.12,1:05:28.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.59,1:05:33.93,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,停下，干
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.00,1:05:35.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.87,1:05:38.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，我不是你要防的人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.57,1:05:41.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你听懂了吗，我不是你要防的人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.44,1:05:43.56,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.64,1:05:46.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上，我建议你活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.04,1:05:50.54,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,等到时钟走到点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.71,1:05:55.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你个好消息，如果另个家伙通过了测试
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.69,1:05:58.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们三个就解放了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.96,1:06:00.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.89,1:06:02.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.79,1:06:05.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你撑不到时候，你的搭档就会被电死
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.96,1:06:08.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,而我的任务
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.20,1:06:12.57,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,给你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.70,1:06:15.60,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,活或死
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.67,1:06:17.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,自己选择
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.78,1:06:21.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,派瑞兹太太？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.28,1:06:24.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，我是彼特·史特姆 我和你的女儿琳达丝是同事
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.05,1:06:28.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个坏消息
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.46,1:07:08.48,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看到没？这是联邦指控 你的名字也在上面
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.56,1:07:11.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,想把其他人名字也放上面？ 你跟我谈谈，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.73,1:07:13.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩具怎么回事？三轮车怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.50,1:07:15.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,在约翰发疯之前，谁是他的生意伙伴？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.87,1:07:17.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他不需要伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.00,1:07:20.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,亚特·布兰克在TM哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.00,1:07:23.10,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,妨碍司法，协同，教唆
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.17,1:07:25.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人同谋
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.51,1:07:26.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.91,1:07:29.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,15分钟以后，更多人会死…警官
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.01,1:07:31.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他的生意伙伴，他的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.85,1:07:34.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我们要找的帮凶
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.12,1:07:35.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他是你TMD律师
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.12,1:07:41.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗？这是我搭档的血
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.29,1:07:43.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,她正在死亡线上挣扎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.73,1:07:46.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你的疯子丈夫
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.90,1:07:49.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,竖锯和亚特·布兰克之间发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.70,1:07:51.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.94,1:07:55.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.47,1:07:59.44,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他也不在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.51,1:08:02.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是TMD什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.65,1:08:10.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要抓狂 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.49,1:08:17.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.09,1:08:20.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有回我电话，伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.03,1:08:24.83,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，约翰，我…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.90,1:08:26.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，我明白
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.94,1:08:29.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个惨剧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.91,1:08:32.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但我要跟你说…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.61,1:08:35.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，约翰，我要告诉你 你工作的这个房子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.11,1:08:37.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你留着吧，给吉尔她那部分
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.15,1:08:40.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,事情不是这样的，约翰，你看，我们是搭档
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.28,1:08:42.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的设计会把这里变的特别
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.79,1:08:45.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,有40户人家会搬进来…40个家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.32,1:08:47.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,低收入家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.59,1:08:49.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就这样撒手不管
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.39,1:08:51.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你是他们的救世主
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.43,1:08:53.49,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.56,1:08:55.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么用这种口气跟我说话？是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.83,1:08:58.56,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没听到我说的吗？ - 我听到了，约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.04,1:09:04.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.01,1:09:07.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.51,1:09:14.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，好好照顾自己
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.75,1:09:18.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉好点以后，给我打个电话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.11,1:09:39.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他怪我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.11,1:09:41.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他永远都不会原谅我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.78,1:09:44.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,在他心里，我们完了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.52,1:09:47.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,不久后他被诊断出癌症
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.33,1:10:00.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你有再和他联系吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.73,1:10:02.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.63,1:10:06.10,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但另一个他从车祸中爬出来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.17,1:10:08.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个他活了下来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.04,1:10:41.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我跟你说过不要到这儿来 - 我要跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.94,1:10:43.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰，约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.97,1:10:47.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个，这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.24,1:10:49.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会有辛希尔的照片？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.28,1:10:51.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你对他干了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.31,1:10:55.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他不要浪费生命
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.92,1:10:57.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你做个游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.95,1:11:00.98,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的一生都是谎言
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.06,1:11:03.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候面对真相了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.09,1:11:05.06,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个隐君子和皮条客
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.13,1:11:08.46,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你把他人的性命当成赌注
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.53,1:11:10.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,今天你赌自己的性命
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.50,1:12:16.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,干！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.27,1:12:23.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,干！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.61,1:12:30.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.65,1:12:32.20,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你干的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.28,1:12:35.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你自己干的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.65,1:12:39.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的贪婪夺走了一个无辜孩子的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.09,1:12:42.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,给我点时间解释下，求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.19,1:12:44.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法给你时间，没人可以
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.86,1:12:46.35,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,时间是幻象
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.43,1:12:49.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，我很抱歉，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.73,1:12:51.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅你了，辛希尔，真的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.83,1:12:53.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,毒品毁了你的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.70,1:12:55.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我在流血
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.47,1:12:57.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,求你放我走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.01,1:13:00.13,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以让你走
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.21,1:13:03.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但那样帮不了你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.18,1:13:07.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你我可以为你做什么，我给你工具
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.28,1:13:10.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,引向你的新生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.32,1:13:13.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,抛弃那些腐化了你灵魂的恶习
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.59,1:13:15.56,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有什么该死的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.63,1:13:17.62,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你来生会有
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.69,1:13:19.99,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,世界上没有因果循环
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.06,1:13:22.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,好人未必好报，恶人未必恶报
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.77,1:13:24.46,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,小偷，不一定被逮到
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.53,1:13:26.50,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,还活得很滋润
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.57,1:13:28.63,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,撒谎，欺骗的人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.70,1:13:30.64,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,被选为领袖
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.71,1:13:33.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,而停下来帮助遇难者的人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.41,1:13:37.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,却因超速驾驶而被逮捕
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.18,1:13:39.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,数不胜数
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.62,1:13:42.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如何打出你手上的牌，才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.95,1:13:45.28,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.35,1:13:47.19,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白我跟你说的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.26,1:13:49.92,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.99,1:13:52.12,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.46,1:13:55.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TMD的疯子！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.84,1:14:11.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.32,1:14:15.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的工具
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.15,1:14:17.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,用来拯救你的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.35,1:14:19.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟你玩个游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.26,1:14:23.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的一生都是谎言
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.86,1:14:27.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候面对真相了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.16,1:14:30.10,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个隐君子和皮条客
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.17,1:14:32.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你靠他人的仁慈生存
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.40,1:14:34.39,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,支付你的毒品
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.47,1:14:36.80,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.87,1:14:39.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把你体内的丑恶都释放出来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.54,1:14:41.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,想要活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.74,1:14:44.21,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须要用自己的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.28,1:14:47.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,来面对你灵魂的丑恶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.45,1:14:52.75,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的脸靠向这些利刃
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.82,1:14:55.05,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,使够力气
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.12,1:14:58.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你就能把你的手和腿从束缚中
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.23,1:15:00.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,解脱出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.73,1:15:02.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,只有使够力量
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.17,1:15:05.90,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,就能自由
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.97,1:15:08.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你个变态狂，操你妈！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.77,1:15:13.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你可以什么多不做 看着自己的血流光
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.74,1:15:17.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,生或者死
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.11,1:15:19.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,自己选择
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.99,1:15:31.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操你妈，变态狂！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.39,1:15:32.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.75,1:16:26.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.22,1:16:28.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TMD死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.35,1:16:32.48,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.07,1:16:48.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.61,1:16:53.07,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.14,1:16:54.97,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.59,1:17:05.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不许再回来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.19,1:17:09.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不能为我做，就替自己想想
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.93,1:17:12.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我也失去了孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.73,1:17:51.13,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“四面墙组成一个家”
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.44,1:18:01.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的孩子是以约翰的第一栋房子起名的，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.78,1:18:04.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 房子在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.15,1:18:06.71,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,房子在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.78,1:18:09.34,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,房子在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.78,1:18:30.01,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（耐心，记住你在救“谁”，有的是时间）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.01,1:18:31.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,这TM是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.01,1:19:22.53,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（最终测试）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.09,1:19:29.16,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操，操
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.53,1:19:34.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好祷告他不要从那扇门里冲出来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.77,1:19:37.86,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谁？谁会从门里冲出来？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.38,1:19:44.78,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.65,1:20:19.94,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你TMD在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.02,1:20:23.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,吉登肉店停车场，布莱克大道11235号
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.75,1:20:25.72,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我等不了两分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.65,1:20:50.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（看我所看到的）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.65,1:20:52.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（感受我的感受）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.65,1:20:54.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（以我的审判来审判）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.65,1:21:08.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,（你学会“谁”是你真正要解救的了吗）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.22,1:21:29.65,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会从门里冲出来？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.06,1:21:43.03,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,干
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.52,1:22:04.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你，亚特
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.49,1:22:40.75,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.76,1:22:46.25,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会从门里冲出来？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.33,1:22:48.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.96,1:22:50.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是TMD谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.60,1:22:54.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.44,1:22:59.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.21,1:23:03.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我吧，狗娘养的！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.05,1:23:08.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我就站在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.15,1:23:12.64,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你没时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.72,1:23:14.75,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,请考虑下你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.16,1:23:22.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,想想你跟我承诺了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.23,1:23:23.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,想想明天
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.77,1:23:25.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,林？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.54,1:23:30.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,林！林！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.45,1:23:41.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.89,1:23:53.02,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.10,1:23:56.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了，这东西会放了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.50,1:24:02.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,放了我！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.61,1:24:09.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你如何选择，杰夫？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.65,1:24:11.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,生或者死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.68,1:24:13.77,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,自己选择
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.85,1:24:15.54,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.59,1:24:18.55,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.62,1:24:20.59,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.89,1:24:26.79,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾瑞克！ - 不要开那扇门！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.86,1:24:28.73,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.00,1:24:32.23,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.37,1:25:14.67,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,“打开门你就能找到我”
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.62,1:25:29.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把TMD的手举起来 - 我的女儿在哪儿，婊子？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.79,1:25:32.95,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,操
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.30,1:25:43.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.58,1:25:57.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 操！ - 哦，你个婊子养的蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.65,1:25:59.68,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你干了什么？ - 我还有时间
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.76,1:26:03.38,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还有时间 - 你为什么要开那扇门？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.46,1:26:05.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是你TMD干的！ - 不，你个蠢猪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.23,1:26:09.29,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,竖锯在考验你，你这个蠢货
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.36,1:26:11.96,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看到你的手！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.03,1:26:14.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 竖锯在TMD考验你 - 别TMD动！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.24,1:26:20.04,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你好，瑞格警官
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.11,1:26:22.74,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你听到了这个 代表你已经成功的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.81,1:26:25.61,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,在90分钟内找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.68,1:26:28.15,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,马修斯和霍夫曼警探
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.22,1:26:30.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,并导致了他们的死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.39,1:26:32.58,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,规则很简单
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.65,1:26:34.52,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告过你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.59,1:26:36.32,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是凯瑞！ - 不要穿过那扇门
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.39,1:26:39.33,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道千万不要穿过不安全的门
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.50,1:26:42.83,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你面对你的梦魇
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.90,1:26:45.66,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能拯救每个人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.73,1:26:47.76,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你学到如何放手了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.80,1:26:51.36,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾瑞克还在受折磨，兄弟 - 是时候放手了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.44,1:26:53.91,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,马修斯警探只有90分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.98,1:26:56.24,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.31,1:26:58.40,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,知道时钟到点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.48,1:27:00.47,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他们必须拯救自己
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.52,1:27:03.31,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.45,1:27:09.08,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的救赎，你无能为力
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.16,1:27:11.13,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你有的是时间
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.19,1:27:13.89,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你的困绕让你等不下去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.96,1:27:16.83,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了马修斯警探
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.90,1:27:18.87,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是救他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.93,1:27:21.06,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你的最终测试失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.81,1:27:31.84,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白的是竖锯怎么做到这些的？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.91,1:27:33.85,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我上次见他的时候，他都快死了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.92,1:27:35.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我不觉得他快死了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.56,1:27:44.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不是阿曼达·杨干的 - 说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.89,1:27:46.88,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她一个人不可能把她吊那么高 - 约翰·克里莫他…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.96,1:27:48.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,他只能动脑子，不能做体力
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.76,1:27:51.70,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须要找到帮助 竖锯和阿曼达·杨的那个人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.94,1:28:04.17,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,看来医院里面又有一个医生失踪了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.25,1:28:09.51,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.52,1:28:14.11,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我们选择的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.41,1:28:33.37,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.40,1:29:03.74,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你掌握了局势，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.84,1:29:08.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你可以不通过测试就离开？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.78,1:29:19.22,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证我的事业会继续
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.29,1:29:22.42,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.49,1:29:24.82,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,听到这个磁带，有人会以为
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.89,1:29:26.69,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,一切结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.76,1:29:30.09,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,但我仍然活在你们中间
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.17,1:29:33.43,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我死了，就全结束了？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.50,1:29:37.30,cn,,0000,0000,0000,,没有结束，游戏才刚刚开始
